# Play test of the plan 'The Long Voyage' (CIPlay plan_long_voyage, in a test world 'CI ...'): Raft's story from its
# start with Raft's own notes read as the game does; after each story island the plan's island must come on the
# Receiver, be played to its end with its own test, and lead on to the next story island - and the side trips, sailed to.
plan The Long Voyage
note RadioTower
expect chain RadioTower unlocked
expect chain cove locked

# The Radio Tower's note leads to Wreckers' Cove first, its quest to Vasagatan
note Vasagatan
expect chain cove unlocked
tune cove
include wreckers_cove.play
expect chain cove done
expect chain Vasagatan unlocked

# Vasagatan's note: Thornwood, then Balboa
note Balboa
expect chain thornwood unlocked
tune thornwood
include thornwood.play
expect chain thornwood done
expect chain Balboa unlocked

# Balboa's note: Scrapyard Haven, then Caravan Town
note CaravanTown
expect chain scrapyard unlocked
tune scrapyard
include scrapyard_haven.play
expect chain scrapyard done
expect chain CaravanTown unlocked

# Caravan Town's note: Ironreef Caverns, then Tangaroa
note Tangaroa
expect chain ironreef unlocked
tune ironreef
include ironreef_caverns.play
expect chain ironreef done
expect chain Tangaroa unlocked

# Tangaroa's note: the Drowned Metropolis, then Varuna Point
note VarunaPoint
expect chain metropolis unlocked
tune metropolis
include drowned_metropolis.play
expect chain metropolis done
expect chain VarunaPoint unlocked

# Varuna Point's note: the Coral Observatory, then Temperance
note Temperance
expect chain observatory unlocked
tune observatory
include coral_observatory.play
expect chain observatory done
expect chain Temperance unlocked

# Temperance's note: Glacier Station, then Utopia - the end of Raft's story
note Utopia
expect chain glacier unlocked
tune glacier
include glacier_station.play
expect chain glacier done
expect chain Utopia unlocked

# The side trips: the library's smaller islands come ahead of the raft while it sails (at 2 to 32 km), each played
# to its end
sail 2
arrive gull
include stranded_gull.play
sail 2
arrive signal
include signal_rock.play
sail 3
arrive ranger
include rangers_rest.play
sail 3
arrive stilt
include stilt_hollow.play
sail 3
arrive wharf
include mayors_wharf.play
sail 3
arrive crane
include crane_yard.play
sail 4
arrive frost
include frost_hollow.play
sail 4
arrive farm
include tide_farm.play
sail 4
arrive mine
include old_mine_islet.play
sail 4
arrive shelter
include shelter_atoll.play
expect blueprints
plan end
